WEBVTT

00:43:59.250 --> 00:44:02.309
CA: So I'm kind of in awe
at the scale at which you're thinking.

00:44:02.333 --> 00:44:04.184
I guess as we wrap up here,

00:44:04.208 --> 00:44:09.309
if I might, I'd love to just
go to a bit more personal place.

00:44:09.333 --> 00:44:11.601
Like, I'm just curious about you

00:44:11.625 --> 00:44:14.851
and what is it in your past

00:44:14.875 --> 00:44:17.309
that is, sort of,

00:44:17.333 --> 00:44:18.857
is providing the fire right now,

00:44:18.881 --> 00:44:22.393
the drive to try to do this?

00:44:22.417 --> 00:44:23.684
How are you?

00:44:23.708 --> 00:44:25.667
How are you feeling about this?

00:44:26.708 --> 00:44:28.851
Tell us a bit about you, please.

00:44:28.875 --> 00:44:32.125
DA: Well, that's a very generous question.